tests/test_transactions.py`\n- [ ] T019 [P] [US2] Test table deletion rolls back in `tests/test_transactions.py`\n\n### Implementation for User Story 2\n\n- [ ] T020 [US2] Capture table state (created/deleted tables) on transaction entry in `tinydb/database.py`\n- [ ] T021 [US2] Apply table creation/deletion to buffer during transaction in `tinydb/database.py`\n- [ ] T022 [US2] Restore table state on rollback in `tinydb/database.py`\n\n**Checkpoint**: User Stories 1 AND 2 both work independently - table management is transactional\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Nested Mutable Value Rollback (Priority: P2)\n\n**Goal**: Nested mutable values (lists, dicts) modified through callable updates are fully restored on rollback.\n\n**Independent Test**: Insert a document with a mutable nested value, use callable update to mutate it inside a transaction, verify nested value is restored after rollback.\n\n### Tests for User Story 3\n\n- [ ] T023 [P] [US3] Test nested mutable value rollback in `tests/test_transactions.py`\n- [ ] T024 [P] [US3] Test callable update rollback in `tests/test_transactions.py`\n\n### Implementation for User Story 3\n\n- [ ] T025 [US3] Implement deep copy snapshot of mutable documents on transaction entry in `tinydb/database.py`\n- [ ] T026 [US3] Apply snapshot restoration on rollback in `tinydb/database.py`\n- [ ] T027 [US3] Ensure query caches don't return discarded work data in `tinydb/database.py`\n\n**Checkpoint**: User Stories 1, 2, AND 3 all work independently - nested mutable rollback is correct\n\n---\n\n## Phase 6: User Story 4 - Persistence Across Close/Reopen (Priority: P3)\n\n**Goal**: Committed data survives database close/reopen; rolled-back data does not persist.\n\n**Independent Test**: Commit a transaction, close database, reopen, verify committed data is present.\n\n### Tests for User Story 4\n\n- [ ] T028 [P] [US4] Test committed data survives close/reopen in `tests/test_transactions.py`\n- [ ] T029 [P] [US4] Test rolled-back 